--- Normal array concatenation ---
res1 len: 4
res1[0]: 1
res1[1]: 2
res1[2]: 3
res1[3]: 4
--- Empty array concatenation ---
empty + empty len: 0
left empty len: 2
left empty[0]: 10
--- Nested arrays concatenation ---
nested len: 3
nested[0][0]: 1
nested[1][0]: 3
nested[2][0]: 5
--- Array + String concatenation ---
array + string: <array>hello
string + array: hello<array>
--- Array + Non-array/non-string concatenation ---
array + number: 0
array + nil: 0
